{"synopsis":"Satu kitab legendaris pemicu badai darah. Satu malam yang merenggut segalanya. Demi membalas kematian orang-orang tercintanya akibat perebutan kitab “Wisdom of the Secret Master”, Woonseon mengubur masa lalunya yang suci. Di dunia Jianghu yang kejam—di mana harta, takhta, dan cinta bersifat fana layaknya bunga yang layu dalam sepuluh hari—kini hanya dendamnya yang menolak untuk mati.","alternative_title":"화무십일홍","author":"Bluebeard, Dongryeon","artist":"404nf","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"92350cd0-557f-4651-91f4-b99d9c0684a3","number":"66","chapter":"66","title":"","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"3897a95f-96df-49a3-85ca-d567d7490e47","number":"65","chapter":"65","title":"","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"f4a84a70-7b72-415e-ac00-c5a3454252f1","number":"64","chapter":"64","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01"},{"chapter_id":"6df9319f-f08b-491a-946a-cbed7ed15873","number":"63","chapter":"63","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"420d863b-79ad-4166-8b9c-86894a2081ca","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30"},{"chapter_id":"c0de9398-8c73-448f-bcb7-9e046e616837","number":"61","chapter":"61","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"6c2fba57-3271-4be5-9ed6-fbe132b92209","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"50fa57f2-5dba-4722-b8ee-63643a36cd20","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"e273aab5-0a1f-4970-b993-31fd92e36629","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"33e87113-8a73-4e58-a474-2a8d1d69222b","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"627a86f5-4db3-44ca-bd0c-522cbf944429","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-